  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Behavior modification therapy intended to displace pleasant associations evoked by homosexuality with unpleasant ones (in the form of electric shocks or nausea-inducing drugs) in order to shift the subject's homosexual orientation to a heterosexual one.</subfield>
