  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Israeli term referring to a woman with masculine development who is usually infertile.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The act of tying up or restraining the body, usually with rope, cuffs, tape, or other adhesive, for the purposes of erotic enjoyment or aesthetic appreciation.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Rooms in nightclubs, sex clubs, or bathhouses where patrons can discretely engage in sexual activity. Dark rooms were common features in gay bars and clubs in the 1960-80s and remain common among swingers today.</subfield>
