  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A garment worn to hold and train the torso into a desired shape, traditionally a smaller waist or larger bottom, for aesthetic purposes (either for the duration of wearing it or with a more lasting effect), or to support the breasts.</subfield>
