  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Written literary works about imaginative or futuristic concepts incorporating science, technology, space, time travel, and other speculative elements; use in reference to science fiction focusing on queer characters or themes.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Written literary works about the investigation of crime or the work of detectives; use in reference to mystery and detective fiction focusing on lesbian characters and themes.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
